msgstr "Es mi fiel hacha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO"
