#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "Seems strong..."
msgstr "Parece fuerte..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
