msgstr "Cuando se cocina, es una exquisitez."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
