msgstr "Qué tonificante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Quite useful for the heat."
