msgstr "Una alfombra cómoda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_OVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_OVAL"
