msgstr "Una alfombra decorada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_PORCUPUSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_PORCUPUSS"
