msgstr "Una alfombra decorada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_ROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_ROUND"
