msgstr "Es bastante básica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_SQUARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUG_SQUARE"
