#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE.GENERIC"
