msgstr "Es de construcción modesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE.SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE.SAND"
