msgstr "Es bastante ingenioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT"
