msgstr "Está llena de artefactos centelleantes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
