msgstr "Disfruto bastante comer esto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN"
