msgstr "¡No caeré víctima de sus adorables ojos!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC"
