msgstr "El santuario de esos adorables depredadores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE"
