msgstr "Ese aroma ahumado siempre me pone hambriento..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED"
