msgstr "No te escapes de mis dedos de mantequilla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
