msgstr "Tendré que encenderte otra vez."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANDLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANDLEHAT"
