#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
