#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
