msgstr "No hagamos nada que vayamos a lamentar, eh... señor..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR"
