#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN"
