#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOODPANELS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOODPANELS"
