msgstr "Ensucié mis guantes buenos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG"
