#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE"
