#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_CINDERBLOCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_CINDERBLOCKS"
