msgstr "A las profundidades..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH"
