msgstr "¿Por qué querría esta cosa horrible?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3"
