#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TURF_DEEPRAINFOREST_NOCANOPY"
