msgstr "¡Ahora podemos aprovechar el viento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING"
