msgstr "Se oye mucho eco ahí adentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT"
