msgstr "Un proveedor de miel particularmente pegajoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTCOMBHOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTCOMBHOME"
