msgstr "Un hábitat fascinante para insectoides."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ANTHILL"
