msgstr "El suelo es aburrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT"
