msgstr "Estiró la pata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.GENERIC"
