msgstr "¡Es un arma poderosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN_POISON"
