msgstr "El corazón de la temible criatura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT"
