msgstr "Carne caliente pa la cena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON"
