msgstr "Le hará falta algo de tierra pa ser útil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE"
